*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Modelo de impressora para termicas TSPL 203 dpi. Projeto etiqueta-termica-10x15 (MIT).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "ETIQTSPL.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Etiqueta Termica"
*Product: "(Etiqueta Termica TSPL)"
*ModelName: "Etiqueta Termica TSPL 203dpi"
*ShortNickName: "Etiqueta Termica TSPL"
*NickName: "Etiqueta Termica TSPL 10x15 (203 dpi), 1.0"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/EtiquetaTermica/rastertotspl"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Tamanho da etiqueta: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w283h425
*PageSize w283h425/Etiqueta 100 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Tamanho da etiqueta: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w283h425
*PageRegion w283h425/Etiqueta 100 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w283h425
*ImageableArea w283h425/Etiqueta 100 x 150 mm: "0 0 283 425"

*DefaultPaperDimension: w283h425
*PaperDimension w283h425/Etiqueta 100 x 150 mm: "283 425"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolucao: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *EtDensidade/Escuro da impressao: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *EtDensidade
*DefaultEtDensidade: 6
*EtDensidade 0/0: ""
